= Mod info

This is a Spartacus League/KPD mod beginning near the end of the Great War.

Many elements of the UI are taken/inspired by <a href="https://www.germanytosave.com/">Germany To Save</a> and <a href="https://zlrsk.github.io/era_demokrasi_liberal/">Demokrasi Liberal: An Alternate History</a>.

Gameplay elements taken/inspired by many of the other great mods made by the community. I will <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/RedAutumnSPD/comments/1tk0whx/all_currently_out_mods_and_games/">link</a> to a reddit post containing many of the mods, however if you wish to see more mods that are in development, check out the <a href="https://github.com/aucchen/social_democracy_alternate_history/forks">forks</a> for SDAAH.

> Currently there very little content, as I am currently working on the superfluous parts of the game. However once that is done, I will likely take a quick break from the project to read several books on the KPD/Spartacus League, which I will then use to make events, advisors, and cards, etc.<br>

>> - data-hash / wrench, 7/23/2026

